nal dependencies (already none, but could use `embed` for configs)\n8. **Install script / package manager** support (Homebrew, Scoop, etc.)\n9. **Structured logging**\n10. **Integration with the whole toolchain** - maybe add a `.open-repo` config file in the repo itself\n\nLet me also check the other config files to understand the full picture.",
